    dynamics.avgDriveSpeed, dynamics.topDriveSpeed.
  - Shift cell colour (shiftColor): D=success, R=danger, N=warning, P=muted, else=secondary.
  - Shift badge tone (shiftBadgeVariant): D=success, R=danger, N=warning, else=neutral.
  - avgDriveSpeedMps = mean(d.avgSpeedMps ?? 0); topDriveSpeedMps = max(d.maxSpeedMps ?? 0);
    nil when no drives -> em-dash. power_kw -> fmtNumber (global precision 2); nil -> em-dash.
  - SI -> display via convertSpeedFromSI (km/h = mps*3600/1000; mph = mps*3600/1609.344), 0 dp.
